---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import PostList from '../../components/PostList.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head><BaseHead title="글 | 송승재" description="AI에 전달하는 지시와 자료, 실행과 결과 확인을 개인 실험으로 살펴봅니다." /></head>
  <body><Header /><main id="main"><div class="list-heading entry"><h1>글</h1><p>AI 도구를 만들고 실험한 내용을 씁니다.</p></div><section class="series-index"><div class="series-intro"><img src="/images/series/seasons.webp" alt="여름과 겨울의 음료를 그린 시리즈 삽화" width="1440" height="960" /><h2>빈칸으로 이해하는<br />LLM 엔지니어링</h2><p>입력에서 결과 확인까지<br />네 편의 글로 설명합니다.</p></div><PostList /></section></main><Footer /></body>
</html>
<style>
  .list-heading { margin-bottom: 56px; } .list-heading h1 { margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: var(--font-editorial); font-weight: 500; } .list-heading p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }
  .series-index { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 64px; }
  .series-intro img { border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .series-intro h2 { font-family: var(--font-editorial); font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .series-intro p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  @media(max-width:900px) { .series-index { grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0,1fr); gap: 32px; } }
  @media(max-width:767px) { .list-heading { margin-bottom: 32px; } .series-index { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; } .series-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr; gap: 0 20px; } .series-intro img { grid-row: span 2; margin: 0; width: 100px; height: 100px; object-fit: cover; } .series-intro h2 { font-family: var(--font-editorial); font-weight: 500; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; } .series-intro p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; } .series-intro p br { display: none; } }
</style>
